=== IS 'DOWNWARD PROPAGATION' A CLASS? ===
  NO CLASS in CMIP6_ensemble (n=1517): the per-event surface response is unimodal (dip p=0.8235), one Gaussian component suffices (BIC-gap p=0.9650), and the whole distribution is a pure SHIFT of -0.476 sigma of the ordinary winter distribution (KS p=0.3456). 'Downward propagation' is a threshold on a continuum, not a population.

